    v4 = PropGet v3 key="last"
    v5 = Add v2, v4
    Return v5
}

# Two names are read from one value of which nothing is known, in a function that runs many times. Each read has a cache of its own and is one call of the shared code. Nothing tests the value in line.
# CHECK-LABEL: name="fullName" role=Source
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#0:
